  "goodToKnow": "Der Ellbogen (also Ellenbogen) is the elbow, from die Elle (ulna, and an old unit of length) and der Bogen (bend). Seine Ellbogen einsetzen means to use one's elbows to get ahead, and die Ellbogengesellschaft is a ruthless, dog-eat-dog society. The funny bone is der Musikantenknochen. During the pandemic, people greeted each other with den Ellbogengruß. The plural is the same: die Ellbogen."
